- Sub-category scores if deductions made (e.g., "Style: 0.6, Neatness: 0.6, Color: 0.4, Finish: 0.4")
- Any NOT VISIBLE items (e.g., "Hair clips not clearly visible")>

Makeup: <x.x>/2.0
<Detailed 2-3 line description stating:
- What was observed
- Sub-category scores if deductions (e.g., "Base: 0.6, Eyes: 0.3 (blending issue), Lips: 0.4, Overall: 0.4")
- Any NOT VISIBLE items (e.g., "Lenses not visible")>

