- Name badge status and score (e.g., "Badge: visible and aligned (0.5)")
- Stockings status and score (e.g., "Stockings: NOT VISIBLE (0.5 - upper body only)")
- Overall appearance (e.g., "Overall: neat, professional (0.5)")
- Total breakdown (e.g., "1.0 + 0.5 + 0.5 + 0.5 + 0.5 = 3.0")>

Issues Found:
- <specific visible violation only if present>
- <next issue only if present>

Recommendations:
- <actionable recommendation if needed>
